\end{equation}

Our result, then, is that even though $U_{\text{mech}}=-\boldsymbol{\mu}\cdot\mathbf{B}$

may not include all the energy of

a system—it is a fake kind of energy—it can still be used with the

principle of virtual work to find the forces on steady current loops.

