\label{Eq:II:24:6}

V_+=z_0I_+.

\end{equation}

Similarly, for the wave going toward minus $x$ the relation is

\begin{equation*}

V_-=z_0I_-.

\end{equation*}

The characteristic impedance—as we found out from our filter

